	<key>readme</key>
	<string>## Usage

Search Bandcamp artists, labels, albums and tracks via the `bc` keyword.

Type `bc` and a query to search Bandcamp as you type.

![Bandcamp search results in Alfred](images/about/main.png)

* `bc &lt;query&gt;` - search bands, labels, albums and tracks as you type.
* &lt;kbd&gt;↩&lt;/kbd&gt; or &lt;kbd&gt;⇥&lt;/kbd&gt; on a band or label - its releases; on an album or track - its tracklist.
* The path builds up in the search box (`bc Keeno &gt; Courage EP`); delete the last part to go back.
* The first row of a page is the page itself: &lt;kbd&gt;↩&lt;/kbd&gt; opens it in the browser, &lt;kbd&gt;⇥&lt;/kbd&gt; goes back.
* Type after a path to filter that page.
* &lt;kbd&gt;⌥&lt;/kbd&gt;&lt;kbd&gt;↩&lt;/kbd&gt; - open the item's Bandcamp page.

### Maintenance

* `:bc` - cache size (&lt;kbd&gt;↩&lt;/kbd&gt; reveals the folder) and Empty Cache.
</string>
